  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Global Action to End Child Labour</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to contribute to child labour elimination in key global value chain sectors for which trade to the EU is significant and where child labour is prevalent in sub-Saharan Africa, South-East Asia, Latin America and Caribbean.</narrative>
